<h2 style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #CB343C; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Tuttle Pool will open Monday, June 7</h2>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">Due to unexpected maintenance, we will not be able to open Tuttle Pool on Monday, May 31. As of right now, Tuttle Pool will open on Monday, June 7.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #444446; margin: 0 0 10px;">We apologize for the inconvenience, and hope you'll join us after June 7! Make sure to sign up at <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/pools/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" style="color: #003087; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">columbus.gov/pools</a> for another time slot.</p>
